-- 4) 730 micro-repair: PEC-PG restriction (notes append: replay once)
UPDATE scholarships SET description = REPLACE(description, 'Foreigners should also know the dedicated federal channel for foreign graduate students, PEC-PG (CAPES with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs), which runs its own selection notices and is not covered by this record;', 'Foreigners should also know the dedicated federal channel for foreign graduate students, PEC-PG (CAPES with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and CNPq), which runs its own selection notices and is not covered by this record - but note that PEC-PG is restricted to citizens of its listed participating countries, and Uzbekistan is not among them in the current notice (Edital 12/2025: in Asia only Bangladesh, China, India, Iran, Lebanon, Pakistan, South Korea, Syria, Thailand and Timor-Leste), so for an applicant from Uzbekistan the realistic Brazilian funding route is the programme-quota system described here;'), notes = notes || ' Enrichment Batch 33 (2026-10-29): PEC-PG is no longer mention-only/unevaluated. CAPES Edital nº 12/2025 (source 3152) and the participating-country lists from CAPES''s own release as republished by UFSC''s international office (source 3153) were read first-hand: eligibility is limited to citizens (resident in) the listed participating countries, and Uzbekistan is not listed (Asia: Bangladesh, China, South Korea, India, Iran, Lebanon, Pakistan, Syria, Thailand, Timor-Leste). No PEC-PG record was created; the description now states the restriction instead of pointing Uzbek readers at a closed channel. No other field changed; rel 10 retained.', last_updated_at = '2026-10-29 17:00:00+05' WHERE id = 730;

